      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your refusal to treat healing as another obligation is wise; true recovery requires dismantling the performative survival that defines your days. Please recognize that stopping the cycle and prioritizing rest is not an escape, but an act of reclaiming your autonomy and humanity. If you have the courage to rest now, you can stop functioning as a cog and simply exist as yourself for the first time in a long time.",
